QUIZ 5. TYPE EACH ANSWER AS APL AFTER THE QUAD PROMPT.
WHAT IS +/1 2 3 4?
⎕:
      10
RIGHT.
WHAT IS ×/2 3 4?
⎕:
      24
RIGHT.
WHAT IS +\1 2 3?
⎕:
      1 3 6
RIGHT.
WHAT IS ⌈/3 9 2?
⎕:
      9
RIGHT.
HOW MANY OF 2 4 6 8 EXCEED 3? TYPE THE NUMBER.
⎕:
      3
RIGHT.
