⎕:
      5 6
RIGHT.
WHAT IS 1↓5 6 7 8?
⎕:
      6 7 8
RIGHT.
WHAT IS ⌽1 2 3?
⎕:
      3 2 1
RIGHT.
WHAT IS 1 0 1/7 8 9?
⎕:
      7 9
RIGHT.
WHAT IS 7 8 9⍳8, THE POSITION OF 8?
⎕:
      2
RIGHT.
